  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certifies that on 3 June 2025 the use of the subdivided house's ground floor front studio flat (Flat 2) as a self-contained dwelling was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).  \r\n\r\nThe applicant has submitted sufficient evidence to demonstrate that, on the balance of probabilities, the house's ground floor front studio flat (Flat 2) had been occupied continuously as a self-contained dwelling (Class C3) since at least 3 June 2021 (four years prior to the validation date of this Lawful Development Certificate Application) and that continued use to this effect would be lawful.  \r\n"
